		r.Push("||SQUEEZE THE MAIN GRIP AT THE SPOT JUST BELOW THE MAIN HAND'S HIP||MHIP MAIN|saber||DO:~SQUEEZE THE MAIN GRIP AT THE SPOT JUST BELOW THE MAIN HAND'S HIP~GET:~THE SABER IS DRAWN INTO THE MAIN HAND, OR PUT BACK. THE OFF HAND THERE IS REFUSED~NEEDS:~RSQ SABER");
